  "narrative": "The new validation confirms H27: within the high-feature_036 stratum, feature_003 positivity is associated with a lower composite dependency score by 0.447 signed units, with a strict independent lower bound of 0.222. This is far above the 0.15-unit threshold and supports a reproducible dataset-specific conditional association. H78 is likewise confirmed and now closed: among individuals who are feature_037-negative but high-feature_036, feature_003 positivity is associated with a lower score by 0.553 signed units, with independent lower bound 0.328. The feature_003 effect therefore is not merely an artifact of co-occurrence with feature_037. The H85 interaction should also be accepted as a strong discovery finding: the raw feature_010 exposed-minus-comparator difference in the high-feature_038 stratum is 0.559 units lower than in the non-high-feature_038 complement, with 95% interval entirely beyond threshold. Because this was a post-hoc reversal from H84, I keep the investigation active and propose the complement simple effect, together with the already registered high-feature_038 simple effect, to determine whether the feature_010 positive association is attenuated, null, or reversed within high feature_038. Overall, the validated evidence now supports three partially independent signal families in this dataset: feature_037 positivity strongly lowers outcome_001, feature_003 positivity lowers outcome_001 conditionally on high feature_036, and feature_010 positivity raises outcome_001 overall but is strongly modified by feature_038. Negative or unresolved areas include the null H5 validation, several closed marginal binary-marker tests, the absent feature_010-by-feature_036 interaction, and the subthreshold or imprecise direct feature_003 contrasts outside the high-feature_036 stratum. Next priorities are the feature_010 simple effects within and outside high feature_038, plus a triple-restricted feature_003 contrast within feature_037-negative, feature_010-negative, high-feature_036 individuals. All statements remain unadjusted dataset-specific associations, not causal or generalizable claims.",
  "research_notes": "Validated dataset-specific claims: H34 feature_037-positive lowers outcome_001 (marginal, discovery + validated). H73-H75 feature_037 lowers outcome_001 in triple-restricted feature_010/003 combinations. H27 feature_003-positive lowers outcome_001 within high feature_036 (validated). H78 feature_003-positive lowers outcome_001 within high feature_036 and feature_037-negative (validated); accepted and closed. Accepted feature_010 claims: H37 overall positive raises outcome_001; H42, H46, H50, H79-H81 show positive feature_010 differences in multiple feature_003/feature_036/feature_037 strata. Important accepted interaction: H85 raw feature_010 difference is much smaller in high feature_038 than in non-high feature_038 (signed +0.559 under negative direction; lower 0.349). Because H85 is a data-driven reversal of H84, keep active and characterize with H51 plus newly registered feature_010 simple effect in non-high feature_038 (<=0.49). Also registered H87-style triple-restricted feature_003 effect within feature_037-negative, feature_010-negative, high-feature_036 to test simultaneous independence from feature_037 and feature_010. Negative/null: H5 feature_031 null after validation; H82 no threshold feature_037-by-feature_038 interaction in registered direction; H53 no feature_010-by-feature_036 interaction; H45 no threshold feature_003-by-feature_010 interaction. Unresolved/deferred: H13 overall feature_003 point estimate 0.141 below threshold; H76 direct feature_003 effect among feature_037-negative/feature_010-negative 0.135 below threshold; H77 feature_003 effect among feature_037-negative/feature_010-positive imprecise; H83 feature_037-by-feature_018 interaction near threshold uncertain. Interpretation: feature_037, conditional feature_003/high-feature_036, and feature_010 are partially independent unadjusted signals, with feature_010 conditional on feature_038. Prioritize next: H51, complement feature_010 simple effect, triple-restricted feature_003 effect, H70/H63/H64 for feature_037 stability, and H52 for feature_010 high feature_018. Validate H85 in next appraise if simple-effect pattern is coherent. Maintain strict dataset-specific wording."
